WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.042
Another language model can help score relevance, style, or groundedness at scale.

00:00:06.042 --> 00:00:11.597
That can be useful, but the judge can also be biased or inconsistent.

00:00:11.597 --> 00:00:19.167
Calibrate automated judging against a smaller set of human-reviewed examples before trusting the scores.

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:25.482
If the judge disagrees with human reviewers on important cases, the automated score should not be treated as

00:00:25.482 --> 00:00:27.201
authoritative.
